WEBVTT

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:34.440
<i>I'm a Tenbi Academy second year student, Amaya Haruko.</i>

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:39.450
<i>My childhood friend, Ooyama Takeru, enrolled as a first year student,</i>

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:42.830
<i>but his alleged fiancée Kushiya Inaho-chan</i>

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:47.160
<i>and Himegami Kodama who is in the same year as me, became his roommates for some unknown reason.</i>

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:51.290
<i>Two girls and a boy who have never met before living under the same roof is impure.</i>

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:55.380
That's why I moved in as well.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.190
Good morning, Takeru-sama.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.400
Ah, good morning.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.190
Oh, ouch.

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:19.530
I'm sorry, but you must also be careful, Takeru.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.910
Sorry, I was worried that Takeru-sama would be lonely.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.290
Also Inaho-chan, try to refrain from scaring me like that in the future.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:31.380
Breakfast will be ready soon, so go wash your face quickly.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.190
B-Black.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:03:00.070
Just what is this? Not once, but twice.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:04.450
Would you like me to clean those filthy eyes of yours?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.460
I was merciful. You should thank me.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.670
If you don't eat up fast, we'll be late.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:20.340
Yes.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.970
Thanks for the food.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.230
How is it?

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.560
Delicious!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.770
<i>Moreover, I feel very nostalgic somehow.</i>

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.190
It's certainly delicious.

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:44.030
Great, isn't it? Being praised by your beloved "Take-chan".

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.780
Himegami-san.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:50.250
Anyway, is it all right? For us to be leisurely sitting here?

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.750
Eh? Oh no!

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.460
Why do I have to run to school like this as well?

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.590
As my roommate, you're not allowed to be late.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.590
The reason for our being late is that guy.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.890
Enough, just run.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:07.970
Yes.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.480
<i>I forgot to ask her yesterday because the situation was chaotic,</i>

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:15.480
<i>but that Maken and also being Take-chan's fiancée.</i>

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.440
<i>Just what's going on?</i>

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.570
Hey, you guys.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:24.030
School has just begun and you already want Minori-chan's paper fan to throw flames?

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.410
Good. Three female students barely made it.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.910
Ah, Takeru-sama is...

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.160
What are you doing?

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:38.670
So he's late, huh? Seems like he'll have to do some work.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.630
Really, always using Shikigami arbitrarily.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.680
Himegami-san.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.310
Great that you made it.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.900
Takeru, are you all right?

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.690
Yeah, somehow.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:02.820
Just now that was...

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.570
That was Himegami-san's ability "Invisible".

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.740
It can move things with an invisible force.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.330
She's the only one able to do that without a Maken.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.670
<i>Those eyes...</i>

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.960
<i>are the same as back then.</i>

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.130
Haruko-san.

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:24.590
President.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.840
You, as a Student Council Vice-President,

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.470
were almost late.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.850
You can't be an example for the new students like this.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.850
I'm very sorry.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.600
Haru-nee, that person is?

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.730
That's the Student Council President, Takaki Furan-san.

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.070
She's this school's number one model student.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:48.320
Also she's famous for being two times as strict as others.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.490
Vice-President.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.240
Yes.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:58.750
Even if this is a co-ed school, talking to a male student from so close up.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:00.710
It's not like that. Take—

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:06.130
No. The new student Ooyama-kun is a childhood friend of mine.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.380
A childhood friend?

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:23.900
A bear?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.070
It's a bear.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:27.780
President...

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:32.530
You're wearing unexpectedly cute underwear.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.950
No!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.540
Hurry to your classrooms.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.340
Here it is.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.460
Sorry for being late.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:48.510
Oh my.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.300
With this everyone in the class has gathered.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.560
Ah, yes.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.430
That guy. I'm sure that yesterday he...

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.390
He came together with a girl.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:02.060
His school life has just started and it's already rose-colored...

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.570
So she's really his girlfriend, isn't she?

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.070
Good, good. Everyone please be quiet.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:12.200
I'm this class's homeroom teacher, Amado Tomika.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.740
Nice to meet you.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.080
And the assistant homeroom teacher is...

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.580
All boys rejoice.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.710
I'm Tenbi Academy's principal and idol, Rokujo Minori-chan.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.750
Then, today we'll immediately start...

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.050
Ignoring me, are you?

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.510
by going to the infirmary and doing a physical checkup.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.260
<i>Physical checkup? So suddenly?</i>

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.430
OK, girls move to the corridor.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.560
I'll go now, Takeru-sama.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:46.610
<i>Somehow, I feel like the boys' stares are piercing me.</i>

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.190
But a physical checkup, huh?

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:52.820
This is a co-ed school. Which means...

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.780
Sensei!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.410
Oh my, what's wrong?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.910
My stomach is aching a little, I need to go to the toilet.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.710
Oh my, that's terrible.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:07.590
Although there is still some time, please hurry.

00:08:07.590 --> 00:08:09.210
Thank you very much.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:10.300
Let's go.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.560
This is it. From here I can see inside the infirmary.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.980
This is the greatest joy of co-ed schools.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.570
Ah, what are you doing?

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:36.320
I'm just interested in this tree.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.120
I'm also very interested in that curtain's gap.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.290
Me too. Don't copy me!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:47.130
<i>When everyone gets undressed please stand in a line.</i>

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.880
<i>Yes.</i>

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.640
Awesome!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:05.350
This is embarrassing.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.690
It's all right, the nurse is a woman too.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.780
60 points.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:13.900
74 points.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:17.320
Aha, what a cute bra. Where did you buy it?

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.370
I got it online.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.500
52 points.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:24.620
59 points.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.880
Ah, the skirt's too tight.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.130
70 points.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.920
I wonder how much I have grown.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.630
68 points.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.430
Such white skin.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.140
How enviable.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.140
70 points.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.020
Uh, I gained weight.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.770
It's already too late.

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.690
75 points.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.610
So you're the type that looks slender with clothes.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.070
Let me feel them a little.

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.820
So soft.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:56.950
80 points.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.200
85 points.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.570
Kimie, you're wearing a t-back?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.330
That's cause I will go on a date with my boyfriend today.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.200
So you're planning to settle it right away?

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.170
Girls with a boyfriend get zero points.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.670
120 points.

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.220
The girl who burst in yesterday.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.430
Good. This is too good.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.890
Go on, go on.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.520
Hey, what are you doing?

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.850
Ah, no.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.730
Oh yeah, that girl...

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:31.940
What? You won't let others see the body of your fiancée?

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.690
No. It's not like that.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.400
She's not my fiancée or anything...

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.150
Takeru-sama.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.110
95 points.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:40.820
Eh? Where?

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.870
Dynamite!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.540
Co-ed schools are the best.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.620
This is paradise on earth.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:50.620
Then let me lead you there.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.880
To the the real kingdom of the sky.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.880
Apparently you haven't reflected on what happened this morning at all.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:01.640
You're Himegami-senpai, if I remember correctly.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:05.640
Seems like you really don't want your eyes anymore.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.060
<i>Looking at her from up close, she's super cute.</i>

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.400
Do you know each other?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.610
We don't.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:20.570
Perverts who peep on girls' bodies.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.870
Himegami-senpai, why are you here?

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.320
Good question.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.620
It may be to grant divine punishment to the enemies of women.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.090
If you're a man, don't sneak around.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:42.590
You need to have something you're worth for, so you can at least face and make a girl fall for you.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:45.050
No, you got something wrong there, Ojou.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.560
Yes, we'll repent.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.060
But it was pretty unexpected.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:56.400
I was afraid you wouldn't be able to control your anger and kill them.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.110
I can't feel it.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:05.450
The feeling I got from him yesterday. That feeling of uneasiness and my blood boiling.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.200
Starting from this morning I haven't felt it at all.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:13.460
The mark on his chest. There should be no mistake.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.710
Why can't I feel anything?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.250
Maken-Ki!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:24.720
Maken-Ki!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:29.510
OK, next.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.770
Straighten up your back.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:34.810
Good, OK.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:36.650
Don't move.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.650
Yes, just like that.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.530
Good, put it in.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.900
You have to put it deeper.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.860
Yes, just like that.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.530
That was too fast. You have to hold back a little.

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.450
OK, pull out your hand.

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:55.710
Next one please.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:56.790
Yes.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.170
What's with that face?

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.550
I fell down just now.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.350
Be careful.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.310
<i>Although the female students here are high level, the teachers are...</i>

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.320
What's so funny?

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:25.320
Ah, I was wondering what this thing is.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:32.040
Well, that's a machine that analyzes the aptitude and compatibility of a person with Maken, "Keronbo".

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.540
After all, we have all kinds of Maken replicas to match every student's nature.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:40.540
Maken? I still don't quite understand that.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.420
Hurry and put it in, you bastard.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.050
This thing's pretty spirited.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.060
Identification impossible.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:58.730
I can't find a suitable Maken for this guy! Damn it!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.110
What's the matter?

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.690
This is the first time this happened since the founding of the school.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.950
Ah, what happened?

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:11.700
Excuse me.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.500
Haruko-senpai.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.460
Haru-nee.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:21.420
You said you can't find a suitable Maken for Take-cha—, erm, Ooyama Takeru-kun.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.340
What's that about?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:27.670
Principal, um, not finding a Maken is...

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.840
Yeah, it's just like that.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:31.760
Impossible.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:39.390
Living for a month without a Maken, huh?

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:42.400
Well, I'm sure it'll work out somehow.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:48.070
Such optimistic thinking is really wonderful.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.410
You gotta take it easy in this world.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.790
That was English, right? You're great, Takeru-sama.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.210
Sorry.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.290
Please throw it back.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.920
Sure, it's coming.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:15.140
Girls certainly are more beautiful when they're laughing.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.600
Ah, again.

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:19.850
Clubs are recruiting new members, huh?

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:25.110
Everyone in Tenbi Academy has to join a club.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:29.240
They proclaim freedom, yet they are pretty forceful on that aspect.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.280
Say Inaho-chan, have you decided on a club yet?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:36.740
Yes, I'll join the same club as you, Takeru-sama.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.000
What's wrong?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:48.590
No, look Inaho-chan, why did you say that you'll protect me and that you're my fiancée?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.300
You don't remember?

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.220
Did I say something wrong?

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:58.430
It's a secret.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.060
If you don't remember, it's a secret.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.560
Please remember.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.400
I didn't have time to eat this morning.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.610
And in my hurry I even forgot my bento and my wallet.

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:18.580
Please eat this.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.460
No, thank you for the notion.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.000
You really like to eat snacks.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.710
Yes.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.170
Ha-Haru-nee.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:29.550
Here, a bento.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:32.970
Thank you, Haru-nee.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:34.840
How long have you been here?

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:42.390
"Inaho-chan, why did you say that you'll...", since then.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:46.690
The atmosphere was so nice, I couldn't come closer.

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.610
N-Not at all.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:49.820
Who knows?

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.230
Ah, right.

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:55.740
I'd like to take a look at all of the clubs after school...

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.910
Haru-nee, can you show me around?

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.250
Impossible!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.710
But this is the truth.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:15.430
Even though it's been ten years since I created this element detector, "Keronbo" is my masterpiece!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:19.510
According to Aki this was made out of scrap.

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.890
A genius isn't picky about his materials.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.390
That's right, I'm a genius! Damn it!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:31.150
But why did three people with unidentifiable elements appear this year?

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.150
Three people?

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:35.400
They told me my element characteristics can't be found either.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:41.790
Well, since she already had a Maken to begin with, it's understandable why hers couldn't be found.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:50.170
The other person with unidentifiable characteristics came from that place. The problem is...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.050
Um.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:52.670
Huh?

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:57.680
Being unable to identify the characteristics of one's Element; is that a serious problem?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.970
It's a great problem!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:02.970
My pride as a genius—

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:08.350
You know that the Maken you get to use is determined by your Element, right?

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:12.270
Yes. But basically, isn't it from now on that I'll be using a Maken?

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.360
The problem is that "from now on".

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:17.950
The hardest will probably be self-defense.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.030
Self-defense?

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.740
Tenbi Academy's battles are...

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.240
Maken Sanbukagura!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.830
You don't learn no matter how often we do this.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.330
Maken Sabu Barutoro.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:30.420
Question.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:35.880
I've been taught that battles can only be carried out if both sides agree to it.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:38.470
Which means that as long as you refuse, there won't be any problem.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:43.640
Y-Yes, that's true. I can't bear to fight against girls.

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:44.310
Yes.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:51.810
Is that sexism, Takeru? Girls are stronger than you think.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:56.570
Also, there are people using Maken outside of battles.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:19:01.570
At such a time, the only one who can protect you is yourself.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:05.910
Is this school that dangerous?

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.830
As I thought, you came to this school without knowing anything.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:14.090
It's all right. I'll protect Takeru-sama.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:18.090
Gen, this guy's Maken. Will it take long?

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:23.090
Who do think I am? Just a month will be enough.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.640
Did you get that? Damn it!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.100
I-I got it.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.020
That guy is Sensei's son?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.400
Yeah.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.030
His character and eyes are the same as Sensei's.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:43.530
The other thing would be the person who holds that Maken.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:47.790
Yeah, the one she holds is probably Maken Kamudo.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:52.290
The sacred land on which Yamata no Orochi is sealed, Amanohara.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.670
Also the eight Maken.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:20:00.760
Personally, I still create with the belief of surpassing the archetypes of the eight Maken.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:04.050
It's about time you stopped speaking about replicas.

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:10.560
Even if it is something God created.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.060
Ah, the ball...

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.270
Impressive.

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.360
Jumping that high, unbelievable.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.530
How beautiful.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.320
Look around the school seriously.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.530
No, I'm being serious.

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.990
This really fits Takeru-sama.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.870
I-Is that so?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.700
Idiot.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.330
Volleyball.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.290
I have a bad feeling.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.290
I knew it! It's coming!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:44.550
Ah, thank you... Inaho-chan.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.140
Everyone's so great.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.060
They're all participating in a club where they can use their Maken.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:55.440
That's right. It's possible to train your Element.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.060
What club are you going to join, Takeru-sama?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:03.070
That's right. I'd rather choose a cultural club.

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:07.280
Um, Retro Game Club,

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:13.000
Insect Sweets Experimentation Club, New Anime Critics Club. What's this one?

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:16.960
This is it!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.920
I'll join this club.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:22.090
Gravure Photography Club?

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.010
Then I'll join that club as well.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:29.430
Eh? Gravure... Could it be?

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:37.270
<i>Good, good. Very cute, Inaho-chan.</i>

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:41.440
<i>You're the best. You're really the best.</i>

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.690
<i>Takeru-sama.</i>

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:47.030
<i>Very good. So pretty. Beautiful.</i>

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.200
<i>Nyaa~ Nyan~</i>

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:51.280
<i>Nice! Good!</i>

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.750
<i>That swimsuit's in the way. Take it off.</i>

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:00.750
<i>Eh?</i>

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:03.130
<i>Inaho-chan, this is art.</i>

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:08.050
<i>Your body has been granted to you by God and it is a unique piece of art.</i>

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:10.600
<i>Be brave.</i>

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:15.770
<i>Yes, Takeru-sama. I'll be brave.</i>

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:23.940
No! No, no, no, I'll absolutely not allow this.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:25.190
Haru-nee...

00:22:28.240 --> 00:22:30.490
What's wrong all of a sudden?

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:40.040
Takeru, you know, right, how about joining the Kenkeibu?

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:42.290
Or rather, join it!

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:45.300
Kenkeibu?

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:47.720
Yes, the Kenkeibu.

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.930
Kenkeibu?

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:52.550
What's that?

00:24:27.860 --> 00:24:30.400
I'm the Kenkeibu's Himegami Kodama.

00:24:30.860 --> 00:24:35.410
Although my roommate Haruko is an outrageous person who uses pads despite being big breasted,

00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:37.870
the food she made is very delicious.

00:24:37.870 --> 00:24:40.080
If you're gonna go after her, do it now.
